# VAL.12 base-image exceptions (origin: node:22-alpine bundled npm CLI).
# Live Dockerfiles now use node:24-alpine (Phase A expiry remediation), whose
# bundled npm is EXPECTED to carry the fixed copies — but no trivy scan of the
# rebuilt node:24 images has been produced yet, so every entry below is
# RETAINED pending CI `security:containers` evidence on the new images. Do not
# delete entries until a HIGH/CRITICAL-clean scan proves them gone. The packages
# below live ONLY under /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm (verified by image
# inspection on the node:22 line; absent from pnpm-lock.yaml and from /monorepo
# app trees) and are not fixable from the app. Expiry: 2026-12-31.

# pacote 19.0.2 bundled in npm CLI (fixed in npm bundled with node >= 24). Expiry: 2026-12-31.
CVE-2026-9496
# sigstore 3.1.0 bundled in npm CLI (fixed 4.1.1 in npm bundled with node >= 24). Expiry: 2026-12-31.
CVE-2026-48815
# tar 7.5.11 bundled in npm CLI, CRITICAL gzip-bomb DoS (fixed 7.5.19 upstream, ships with node >= 24 npm). Expiry: 2026-12-31.
CVE-2026-59873
